  "body": "﻿## What changed\n\nImplements Part B of the update check feature (check, Settings toggle, and title-bar notice). Part A (release `SHA256SUMS.txt` publication) is handled upstream by PR #3110 after PR #3404 closed, and Part C (download, SHA-256 verify, and install) waits for Part A.\n\n- Added GitHub Releases API check (`api.github.com/repos/NeoTech/Camcraft/releases/latest`), SemVer comparison, HTTPS release-notes URL check, and 24-hour UTC throttle in `crates/app/src/update_check.rs` (disabled on `wasm32`, no credentials or telemetry, silent on offline or error states).\n- Added `checkForUpdates` and `lastUpdateCheckUtc` in `prefs.json` (`crates/app/src/prefs.rs`) and split `panel-setups.json` storage into `crates/app/src/prefs_setups.rs` to stay within the 400-line file rule.\n- Added a one-shot background watcher (`crates/ui/src/update_check.rs`) started only in native `shell_window::run_windowed` and triggered once per startup via winit `EventLoopProxy`.\n- Added a top-band `Settings` dropdown (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/settings_drop.rs`) with the `Check for updates` toggle and a title-bar `Update available: vX.Y.Z` button (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/update_notice.rs`) beside the build badge that opens the release-notes link via `crates/ui/src/egui_app/browser_open.rs`.\n- Recorded UI placement and persistence decisions in `docs/decisions/2428-update-check-ui.md`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Pinning tests (`head` `a887ad293cff7757986afda4faeabef2ef6dc155`, verified by separate `gate-runner`):\n  - `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-app --test update_check --test view_prefs`: passed (`update_check`: 4 passed, 0 failed; `view_prefs`: 10 passed, 0 failed).\n  - `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --test-threads=1`: passed (`1431 passed, 0 failed, 7 ignored`), including all 4 `egui_app::tests::update_check::*` tests. (`ui suites: lib` hit known Windows multi-threaded access violation #3379 under `--test-threads=10` in `gate quick`.)\n- `cargo xtask gate quick`: 21 of 22 steps passed (`app suites: lib` 297 passed, `update_check` 4 passed, `view_prefs` 10 passed, and all 16 UI integration suites including `shell` 21 passed and `feedback` 7 passed); only multi-threaded `ui suites: lib` failed with #3379 before passing single-threaded above.\n- `cargo clippy -j 10 -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (exit 0).\n- `cargo test -j 10 --release -p camcraft-app --test update_check -- --ignored`: passed (`0 passed, 0 failed, 4 filtered out`).\n- Trial merge against `upstream/main` (`43217a7c4`): clean (`git merge-tree --write-tree` exit 0).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `app heavy` lanes reached by `crates/app/src/lib.rs` (206 steps in `cargo xtask gate heavy --dry-run`): not run - owed to the wave run before merge (#3467).\n- Live network check against `api.github.com/repos/NeoTech/Camcraft/releases/latest`.\n- `wasm32` target compilation (`wasm32-unknown-unknown` toolchain target not installed locally; guarded by `#[cfg(not(target_arch = \"wasm32\"))]`).\n- Manual before/after desktop screenshots.\n\nfork synced at v0.25.0\nChangelog: Desktop builds check GitHub Releases at most once a day and show an Update available notice in the title bar, with a Settings toggle.\nEffort: high\n\nRefs #2428\r\n",
